WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.602
Today we will use voice, space and roles to tell a story. Our work connects with

00:00:05.602 --> 00:00:07.965
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:12.005
Assign a speaker, listener and narrator for a short scene.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:16.237
Practise lines with clear facial expression and turn-taking.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:22.526
Act the scene once and revise a confusing gesture. Justify a revision using evidence

00:00:22.526 --> 00:00:24.071
from another world tradition.
